{0}{Now remember, mister, Lady Mi is a very sensitive person. She doesn't take crap from anyone, especially from strangers.}{Now remember, miss, Lady Mi is a very sensitive person. She doesn't take crap from anyone, especially from strangers.}{}{}{}{}
{1}{Hello, mister. Going to the 'House of Dreams', I presume?}{Hello, miss. Going to the 'House of Dreams', I presume?}{}{}{}{}
{2}{Hi, mister. You goin' to the 'House of Dreams'? Great place, I can assure you that.}{Hi, miss. You going to the 'House of Dreams'? Great place, I can assure you that.}{}{}{}{}
{3}{G'day to ya fella. The name's Kyote. I'm just standing about n' trying to get the lasses to look under me knickers.}{Heh! You looking for work with the lovely Lady Mi eh'? Well, with a face like yours, you'd best not ask for a pay advance.}{}{}{}{}
{4}{G'day, mister! I'm Kyote, welcome to Lady Mi's establishment.}{G'day, miss! I'm Kyote, welcome to Lady Mi's establishment.}{}{}{}{}
{5}{Came back for more from ol' Kyote did ya? They always do.}{Came back for more from ol' Kyote did ya? They always do.}{}{}{}{}
{6}{You're probably wonderin' why they call me Kyote. Well, it's because I make folks howl for more...though some say it's because I keep folks at bay. *shrug*}{You're probably wonderin' why they call me Kyote. Well, it's because I make folks howl for more...though some say it's because I keep folks at bay. *shrug*}{}{}{}{}
{7}{Let me introduce myself: I'm Kyote, and I be standin' here tryin' to catch the ladies' attention.. }{Let me introduce myself: I'm Kyote, and I be standin' here tryin' to catch the ladies attention.. Maybe you'd like to peek under me robes, eh?}{}{}{}{}
{8}{Hello! I'm Kyote! And this is the 'House of Dreams'. Step right in, fella, see if it's what ya like.}{Hello! I'm Kyote! And this is the 'House of Dreams'. Step right in, miss, see if it's what ya like.}{}{}{}{}
{9}{Arrr! This is Lady Mi's House of Dreams, welcome!}{Arrr! This is Lady Mi's House of Dreams, welcome!}{}{}{}{}
{10}{G'day, mister, step right in, this is the House of Dreams!}{G'day, miss, step right in, this is the House of Dreams!}{}{}{}{}
