{14}{Hey! You know of any attractive ladies here in Nodnol? I'd like to show 'em what I gots right here [points to his robes]}{What I got under here... [points to his robes]...is far better then what you will find in there. [points to Lady Mi's behind him.]}{}{}{}{}
